	"Description": "This mod changes the four Dwarf Scrolls, and makes them animate.All the Dwarf Scrolls can shine with animated flame.This time I add a config file that you can change the Dwarf Scrolls for true or false.\n<br />I also add a non-animated version. If you want to use it, you must change the config file in the '[CP-A]Animated Dwarf Scroll' folder for false, or you can just delet the '[CP-A]Animated Dwarf Scroll' folder.\n<br />Make sure you have installed Content Patcher, Content Patcher Animations and SMAPI - Stardew Modding API and put them into mods folder.Have fun.",
